  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 135,
        "endIndex": 279,
        "text": "#### **[0] Dolly Parton has died**\n* **Confirmed:** Country music legend Dolly Parton died on August 25, 2026, at age 80 in Nashville, Tennessee"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 281,
        "endIndex": 380,
        "text": "Her death was publicly announced by her family (nephew Bryan Seaver) and confirmed by her publicist"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        1,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 382,
        "endIndex": 496,
        "text": "Representatives stated she passed away at the Vanderbilt-Ingram Cancer Center following a brief battle with cancer"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 498,
        "endIndex": 620,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Initial tabloid speculation mentioned acute kidney issues prior to the official statement confirming cancer"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 707,
        "endIndex": 1043,
        "text": "#### **[1], [7], [11] Apple introduces M6, M5 Ultra, and new Mac mini / Mac Studio models**\n* **Confirmed:** Apple officially announced its next-generation silicon—the 2nm **M6** chip and the quad-architecture **M5 Ultra**—alongside new Mac mini (M6 and M5 Pro) and Mac Studio (M5 Max and M5 Ultra) desktop models on August 25, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1046,
        "endIndex": 1125,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** These announcements originate directly from Apple Press Releases"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1127,
        "endIndex": 1245,
        "text": "Performance claims (e.g., up to 4.3x faster AI compute, 2nm efficiency gains) are Apple’s internal benchmark figures"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1379,
        "endIndex": 1625,
        "text": "#### **[4] OpenAI Jalapeño chip benchmarks outperforming Nvidia Blackwell**\n* **Confirmed:** At the Hot Chips 2026 conference, OpenAI disclosed the first benchmark metrics for its Broadcom-developed custom inference ASIC, codenamed **Jalapeño**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1627,
        "endIndex": 1924,
        "text": "Independent analysis by *SemiAnalysis* using the open-source *InferenceX* benchmark showed Jalapeño achieving 1.5×–1.9× higher processing capacity per watt and 1.7×–3.6× lower latency compared to Nvidia Blackwell GPU clusters on open-weight models (including GPT-OSS 120B and DeepSeek R1)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1926,
        "endIndex": 2012,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Jalapeño is an ASIC strictly optimized for AI inference (not training)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2014,
        "endIndex": 2108,
        "text": "The comparison relies on OpenAI-provided execution data run through SemiAnalysis’s framework"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2172,
        "endIndex": 2405,
        "text": "#### **[6] TfL delays delay London robotaxi rollout timeline**\n* **Confirmed:** The *Financial Times* reported on August 26, 2026, that Transport for London (TfL) has delayed publishing regulatory safety guidance for driverless taxis"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2407,
        "endIndex": 2565,
        "text": "As a result, operators (including Waymo, Wayve, and Baidu) have pushed back expectations of launching fully driverless commercial services in London this year"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2567,
        "endIndex": 2722,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Operators have not abandoned London plans; the delay is driven by local regulatory guidance timeline slips rather than technology withdrawal"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2819,
        "endIndex": 3081,
        "text": "#### **[10] FDA authorizes Abbott Libre Duo (continuous dual ketone & blood sugar wearable)**\n* **Confirmed:** On August 25, 2026, the US FDA authorized Abbott's *Libre Duo 10 Day Continuous Dual Glucose-Ketone Monitoring System* for individuals aged 2 and older"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3083,
        "endIndex": 3246,
        "text": "It is the first wearable device cleared in the US to continuously monitor ketone levels and the first globally to track both glucose and ketones in a single sensor"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3248,
        "endIndex": 3315,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The authorization covers sensor measurement accuracy"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3248,
        "endIndex": 3435,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The authorization covers sensor measurement accuracy; real-world efficacy in reducing Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA) hospitalizations will require downstream clinical tracking"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3665,
        "endIndex": 3818,
        "text": "served cease-and-desist letters demanding the permanent takedown of Nitter (the open-source X/Twitter frontend) and primary mirror instances like XCancel"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3820,
        "endIndex": 3915,
        "text": "Official instances have gone offline and development is halted while legal counsel is consulted"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3917,
        "endIndex": 4038,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** A few independent, third-party self-hosted instances remain temporarily accessible outside US jurisdiction"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4143,
        "endIndex": 4413,
        "text": "#### **[3] Pew Research: 34% of Americans use AI chatbots for health queries**\n* **Confirmed:** Pew Research Center published a study (survey of 3,488 US adults conducted late June 2026, released Aug 25, 2026) showing 34% of Americans use AI chatbots for health purposes"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        19,
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4415,
        "endIndex": 4549,
        "text": "Primary drivers include obtaining quick health info (28%), self-diagnosing symptoms (25%), and accessing free health information (22%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4551,
        "endIndex": 4628,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Data is based on self-reported survey responses from US adults"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4692,
        "endIndex": 4945,
        "text": "#### **[13] AM Intelligence orders 9,000 Nvidia Vera Rubin systems for $8B Indian AI project**\n* **Confirmed:** Indian AI infrastructure firm AM Intelligence (backed by Greenko Group) placed a binding order for 9,000 Nvidia Vera Rubin NVL72 rack systems"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
