      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5204,
        "endIndex": 5474,
        "text": "#### **[12] HP and Huawei sign global Wi-Fi patent cross-licensing agreement**\n* **Confirmed:** HP and Huawei signed a multi-year global cross-licensing deal covering standard-essential Wi-Fi patents (including Wi-Fi 6 and Wi-Fi 7), resolving a 2025 European patent suit"
