    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5697,
        "endIndex": 6033,
        "text": "#### **[14] YMTC targets top NAND flash market spot ahead of $5B IPO**\n* **Confirmed:** The *Financial Times* reported that YMTC (Yangtze Memory Technologies Corp) informed prospective investors during Shanghai IPO preparation meetings (aiming to raise $5B) that it intends to become the world's largest NAND flash supplier by late 2027"
      },
