        "startIndex": 6261,
        "endIndex": 6459,
        "text": "#### **[9] Intel details 256-core Xeon 7 \"Diamond Rapids\" at Hot Chips**\n* **Confirmed:** Intel presented technical package details for its 2027 Xeon 7 (\"Diamond Rapids\") processor at Hot Chips 2026"
